  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Expecting_hatchling.jpg\" title=\"The Expecting Hatchling\"><img alt=\"The Expecting Hatchling\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"216\" src=\"/images/Expecting_hatchling.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Expecting_hatchling.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Expecting Hatchling</div></div></div>\n<p>The Expecting Hatchling is found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">Maerz Catacombs of Doom</a> off of Level 3 of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>.  When slain she will drop Hatchling Eggs which are a necessary ingredient for the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest_Pot_Luck_I_%282%29\" title=\"Widower's Nest Pot Luck I (2)\">Widower's Nest Pot Luck I (2)</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
